-- Demo data for the Class Schedule module (AY 2026-2027, 1st Semester).
-- Applied by database/migrate.php only when SMS2_SEED_DEMO=1. Rows link by codes,
-- so the file does not depend on auto-increment ids. It passes the Conflict Checker
-- rules except for one Draft entry that deliberately double-books a room.






